I just had a very strange "bug" manifest itself. My dog, polmorphed into
a keystone kop died of hunger, and also being bashed by the stooges (I think).
Of course as a cop it regenerated but then every move it re-died due to hunger.
It just sat there blocking the only corridor and I had to dispatch the thing
myself.

p.s. I liked the idea put forward recently of an ice cave level, would be good
with new cold loving mosters e.g. wolves, polar bears etc. In a similar vein
a soggy level full of swamps and water loving creatures would be intersting,
you would have to take off your armour and drop all but your weapon, but
then you can swim, a la tarzan, and go get those crocs and eels etc. I
suppose you could still wear rings to protect from shocks.

